TOURNAMENT ANALYSIS
============================================================================================
Hamiltonian proof path:
  weighted_summand_fibres > height2_relation_coverage > freiman_gap_scout > multiplicand_sign_parity > finite_residue_character > ordinary_pair_sums > raw_speed_vertices
score_hist = {0: 1, 1: 1, 2: 1, 3: 1, 4: 1, 5: 1, 6: 1}
